In PostgreSQL, EXPLAIN ANALYZE actually executes your SQL query on the server, discards the result rows instead of sending them to your client, and returns the query execution plan enriched with real runtime measurements.
While standard EXPLAIN only displays what the query planner guesses will happen using table statistics, EXPLAIN ANALYZE shows ground truth—what the executor actually did, step by step.

